msgctxt "BODY_RULE4"
msgid ""
"\tAn effective scout keeps an eye on their <color=#0f7f00>Stamina Bar</color> at all times. If it runs out, you'll be temporarily unable to run, jump, and most importantly, "
"climb. <br><br>\tWorst case scenario, you could fall off the mountain to your death, which is the worst thing to fall off to!"
msgstr ""
"\tPadanyei nihai kricha nyeing chwm khre <color=#0f7f00>Nwsev</color> dein fanivari. Peifaht kahmwvaht hwngrh, sahdaigrebei pingwv, pihe, chev dwrenniv: preiheppihekrh. "
"<br><br>\tDein krise nyavniv, sahdai ya hechin hekkanw hei krav shre, khpw nw nyavniv ya hei!"

