msgid "LIFE IS PAIN!"
msgstr "MWM MW KREIM!"

# cuts are natural things.. right?
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\tAs you make your way through the untamed wilderness, it's inevitable that you'll get some scratches and bumps.<br><br>\tThe more hurt you get, the less "
