msgctxt "BODY_RULE5"
msgid ""
"\tAs you make your way through the untamed wilderness, it's inevitable that you'll get some scratches and bumps.<br><br>\tThe more hurt you get, the less <color=#0f7f00>Stamina</"
"color> you'll have to run and climb, so tend to your injuries as soon as possible with a bandage or a healing herb!"
msgstr ""
"\tDein pipihen pahnyeina heram, khpw nanen serahfbei yahtchi ninaht ni myemwm.<br><br>\tPeifaht shrahf kreim hei, serah ya <color=#0f7f00>Nwsev</color> hei pingwv ni "
"preiheppihe, chav fahnye kreichim shre dein krise deinivniv, nirh nwnahvahnye chev nwram fahnye!"

