#, fuzzy
msgctxt "TITLE_RULE6_1"
msgid "<BR><SIZE=30>(ACTUALLY, DON'T!)"
msgstr "<BR><SIZE=30>(KRAHGEI HEI, PRAIKRH!)"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "BODY_RULE6"
msgid ""
"\tGetting hurt isn't the only way for your <color=#0f7f00>Stamina</color> to go downhill fast. As you climb, you'll find yourself experiencing <color=#b58200>Hunger</color>, for "
"which 10/10 experts recommend eating food.<br><br>\tBe cautious of eating plants from the wilderness! They could poison you and really mess up your day. If you have the option, "
"choose a packaged snack from a corporation you trust!"
msgstr ""
"\tMwvaht kreim mwken faht fringvah hei ya <color=#0f7f00>Nwsev</color> shre. As you climb, you'll find yourself experiencing <color=#b58200>Hunger</color>, for which 10/10 "
"experts recommend eating food.<br><br> \tBe cautious of eating plants from the wilderness! They could poison you and really mess up your day. If you have the option, choose a "
"packaged snack from a corporation you trust!"

#, fuzzy
#| msgid "DON'T OVERPACK!"
msgctxt "TITLE_RULE7"
msgid "DON'T OVERPACK!"
msgstr "DAHFGRH FANIVAI!"

msgctxt "BODY_RULE7"
msgid ""
"\tPutting a backpack on is a great way to carry additional items, which can make the difference between life and death!<br><br>\tHOWEVER, the more <color=#61380a>Weight</color> "
"you carry, the less stamina you'll have to climb! An experienced scout knows to pack everything they need... and nothing more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_RULE8"
msgid ""
"\tIn a survival situation, one of the worst things that can happen is getting separated from the group. <br><br>\tMaintain constant communication whenever possible, and point "
"out your next route in advance to avoid leaving a friend behind!"
msgstr ""

