msgctxt "BODY_BONUSPAGE0"
msgid ""
"Dear Diary, bad news!!!<br><br>\tThe ship captain made an oopsy, and we've wound up crashed on this mysterious island! Thankfully, mysterious islands are my specialty."
"<br><br>\tWith our whole troop working together, we'll reach the top of the PEAK and signal for help in no time!<br><br>\tIn the meantime, I'll take this opportunity to add some "
"additional pages to my famous guidebook.<br><br>\t<align=right>-Scoutmaster Myres"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BONUSRULE"
msgid "BONUS RULE"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
#| msgid "CLUSTER SHROOM"
msgctxt "TITLE_BONUSRULE1"
msgid "SCAN YOUR SHROOMS!"
msgstr "PREVMWMEPHP"

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE1"
msgid ""
"\tMushrooms can be a valuable source of nutrition in the wilderness. But watch out!! Some of them can kill you, or even make you poop your pants.<br><br>\tThere's always a way "
"to tell the poisonous ones apart, though. Here's just one example!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "TITLE_BONUSRULE2"
msgid "GATHER 'ROUND THE FIRE!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE2"
msgid ""
"\tIf you find a nice place to light a campfire, make sure to bring your friends close by first! The fire brings something even better than heat and cooked food... and that's "
"motivation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "TITLE_BONUSRULE3"
msgid "EMBRACE THE OCCULT!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE3"
msgid ""
"\tWuh woh! One of our scouts stepped on a sea urchin and died!!! I was about to get really sad... but one of the other kids touched a weird statue, and brought their friend back "
"to life!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE3_1"
msgid "Seems like this island bends the rules of mortality itself... how wacky! Perhaps something else interesting might happen if we use a statue when everyone is still alive..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "TITLE_BONUSRULE4"
msgid "HUDDLE UP!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE4"
msgid ""
"\tAs we approach the PEAK, the temperature has begun dropping dramatically. Seeking constant cover is a must, and getting caught out in the open when the wind is strong can be a "
"death sentence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE4_1"
msgid "\tIf all else fails, huddling with your friends to share body heat might just save you from an icy grave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "TITLE_BONUSRULE5"
msgid "I JUST NEED A NAP..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE5"
msgid "\tI saw such a pretty sight... a beautiful moon-shaped fruit, surrounded by fireflies...<br><br>\tI feel so relaxed now... maybe a nap wouldn't be so bad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "TITLE_BONUSRULE?"
msgid "WHERE'D EVERYONE GO?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "BODY_BONUSRULE?"
msgid ""
"\tI had such a wonderful nap, but when I woke up the rest of the troop was gone!<br><br>\tI'm sure they're just around the corner. They wouldn't be so foolish as to break "
"<color=red>Rule 0</color> just because I needed a little lie-down!"
msgstr ""

